--- !u!114 &1870903370
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1870903367}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 2f9eb3d1945ff1640a88058f7d4f2b42, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Neo.Rpg.Demo::Neo.Samples.ModuleDemoSceneInfo
  _moduleName: "Neo.Audio \xB7 AM + AMSettings"
  _purpose: One AM plays addressable sound entries and crossfading music pools; AMSettings
    keeps the player's volumes and mutes. Every control calls the real components
    directly.
  _runtimeApi: AM.I.Play("shot") / PlayAt / PlayMusicPool("pads") / NextMusicTrack
    / StopMusic / SetUiVolume; AMSettings.I.SetMusicVolume / SetEfx / SetMusic; events
    OnMusicStarted, OnRandomMusicTrackChanged, OnMusicStopped.
  _sceneWorkflow: Select 'Audio Demo' to see the AM Sounds and Music lists (ids,
    clip sets, pitch, Loop / Shuffle pools); [Demo] Services holds AMSettings and
    MusicControl. Buttons, sliders and toggles are wired in their On Click / On Value
    Changed lists.
  _verification: 'Enter Play Mode: each sound button plays its entry, Theme loops,
    Pads shuffle with crossfades, and mutes/volumes survive a restart.'
  _showRuntimeOverlay: 1
  _corner: 0
  _accentColor: {r: 0.25, g: 0.79, b: 0.94, a: 1}
  _backgroundColor: {r: 0.11764706, g: 0.11764706, b: 0.15686275, a: 0.8509804}
  _panelWidth: 460
  _startCollapsed: 0
  _hints:
  - Buttons -> AM.Play(id) directly (NoCode); 'UI click' is a PlayAudioBtn
  - Music buttons -> MusicControl.PlayPool / NextTrack / StopMusic
  - Sliders and toggles -> AMSettings (saved); MuteMusic/MuteEfx.OnChanged -> labels
  _overlayRoot: {fileID: 935754880}
  _titleLabel: {fileID: 1888914408}
  _descriptionLabel: {fileID: 1547261389}
  _hintsLabel: {fileID: 745905344}
  _collapseLabel: {fileID: 1984763476}
  _collapsibleParts:
  - {fileID: 1994257499}
  - {fileID: 968179692}
